# i18n

- `src/locales/default/<namespace>.ts` is the **TypeScript source of truth**. Add new keys here first.
- Also add matching keys to `locales/zh-CN/<namespace>.json` **and** `locales/en-US/<namespace>.json` by hand.
- **Never** run `pnpm i18n` — CI handles all other locales automatically.
- A new namespace (e.g. `tools.ts`) also requires creating both JSON files (`tools.json` in each locale). Don't forget this.
